  "description": "A robust .NET 8 library for handling OAuth2 Client Credentials and Password Grant flows with Elvid. Supports multiple named clients, automatic token management with caching, retry logic, and seamless HttpClient integration.",
  "id": "Elvia.Elvid.TokenClient",
